shield-leaders-from-us-presidents-worst/articleshow/123705134.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trumps-personal-rapport-with-pm-modi-is-gone-says-former-us-nsa-john-bolton-warns-ties-wont-shield-leaders-from-us-presidents-worst/articleshow/123705134.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-05T00:07:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123705315,imgsize-45884.cms"/></item><item><title>Wedding crasher steals $60k in bizarre California heist: Suspect enjoys drink, escapes in Mercedes</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123703307.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/wedding-crasher-steals-60000-in-bizarre-california-heist-suspect-enjoys-drink-and-escapes-in-mercedes-suv-caught-on-camera/articleshow/123703307.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/wedding-crasher-steals-60000-in-bizarre-california-heist-suspect-enjoys-drink-and-escapes-in-mercedes-suv-caught-on-camera/articleshow/123703307.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-04T23:22:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123704379,imgsize-886153.cms"/></item><item><title>Mortgage fraud case: DOJ launches criminal probe into fed governer Lisa Cook; alleged multiple primary residences</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123702866.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mortgage-fraud-case-doj-launches-criminal-probe-into-fed-governer-lisa-cook-alleged-multiple-primary-residences/articleshow/123702866.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mortgage-fraud-case-doj-launches-criminal-probe-into-fed-governer-lisa-cook-alleged-multiple-primary-residences/articleshow/123702866.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-04T21:44:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123702885,imgsize-512371.cms"/></item><item><title>The new nationalism: Musk, Meloni, and the rise of anti-immigration rhetoric</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123702440.cms" /&gt;Across the globe, anti-immigration movements are surging, fueled by economic anxieties, cultural clashes, and geopolitical upheaval. Political leaders and influencers amplify these sentiments, framing immigration as a threat to national identity and security. Despite evidence of migrants' economic contributions, fear-driven narratives dominate, polarizing societies and shaping policy debates.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-new-nationalism-musk-meloni-and-the-rise-of-anti-immigration-rhetoric/articleshow/123702440.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-new-nationalism-musk-meloni-and-the-rise-of-anti-immigration-rhetoric/articleshow/123702440.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-04T21:38:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123702701,imgsize-168870.cms"/></item><item><title>Roblox blocks voice and in-game chat in Saudi Arabia, UAE to protect underage players</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123696470.cms" /&gt;Roblox has suspended voice and text chat features in Saudi Arabia and the UAE amid rising concerns over child safety. The move follows regulatory discussions and a Guardian investigation exposing serious safety lapses. With growing regional bans and legal action abroad, Roblox is enhancing Arabic moderation tools as it faces pressure to better protect its predominantly young user base.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/roblox-blocks-voice-and-in-game-chat-in-saudi-arabia-uae-to-protect-underage-players/articleshow/123696470.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/roblox-blocks-voice-and-in-game-chat-in-saudi-arabia-uae-to-protect-underage-players/articleshow/123696470.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-04T21:16:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123702541,imgsize-1912491.cms"/></item><item><title>Congo's health ministry announces new Ebola outbreak</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123703078.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/congos-health-ministry-announces-new-ebola-outbreak/articleshow/123703078.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/congos-health-ministry-announces-new-ebola-outbreak/articleshow/123703078.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-04T22:04:11+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123703119,imgsize-950796.cms"/></item><item><title>Sudan rescuers pull 370 bodies from Darfur landslide</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123703277.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/sudan-rescuers-pull-370-bodies-from-darfur-landslide/articleshow/123703277.cms</link><guid>https: