gh. UAE is placed in Group A alongside India, Pakistan, and Oman. The tournament begins on September 9, and UAE will open their campaign against India on September 10 in Dubai.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-squad-for-asia-cup-2025-announced-full-list-captain-and-match-schedule/articleshow/123700913.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-squad-for-asia-cup-2025-announced-full-list-captain-and-match-schedule/articleshow/123700913.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-04T19:44:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123701385,imgsize-970495.cms"/></item></channel></rss>